msgid ""
"A React client and Express service coordinate visual graph editing, "
"persistence, and inspectable algorithm structure."
msgstr ""
"Un client React et un service Express coordonnent l'edition visuelle des "
"graphes, la persistance et une structure algorithmique inspectable."

